# NOTICE

Sangam is original code. Where ideas, patterns, or APIs were adapted from
open-source projects, they are credited below. No code was copied from
projects with branding-restricted or copyleft licenses (Open WebUI,
OpenPanel, Fooocus, VoiceStudio) — those are integrated only as separate
services over their public APIs, or used as idea sources.

## MIT / Apache-2.0 licensed inspirations

- **OpenHands** (MIT) — agent loop patterns (inspect → plan → act → observe →
  iterate), code-as-action, sandboxed tool execution. Reimplemented natively.
- **orca** (MIT) — parallel agent fan-out/fan-in, per-agent failure isolation.
- **munder-difflin** (MIT) — multi-agent stage view, approvals inbox, per-run
  budgets. (Pixel art assets NOT reused — separate license.)
- **ECC** (MIT) — harness patterns: confidence-scored instincts, TDD workflow
  gates, doctor/health-check pattern.
- **Graphify** (MIT) — AST-based code knowledge graph with EXTRACTED/INFERRED
  edge provenance. Reimplemented natively (Python AST).
- **spec-kit** (MIT) — spec → plan → tasks workflow (skill pack).
- **archify** (MIT) — diagram-generation skill patterns.
- **pi** (MIT) — agent loop patterns (skill pack).
- **MemPalace** (Apache-2.0) — typed memories, importance-ranked recall,
  consolidation patterns.
- **codebase-memory-mcp** (MIT) — consumed as an MCP server (not vendored).
- **scientific-agent-skills** (MIT) — science skill pack content format.
- **OpenMAIC** (Apache-2.0) — classroom/roundtable learning patterns.
- **OmniRoute** (MIT) — consumed as a gateway service over its OpenAI-compatible API.

## Idea-only sources (no code)

- **Open WebUI** — UX reference (chat, palette, artifacts). Branding-restricted license.
- **OpenPanel** (AGPL-3.0) — analytics UX ideas only.
- **Fooocus** (GPL-3.0) — driven as a separate local service via its public API.
- **VoiceStudio** (AGPL-3.0) — referenced as a compatible server endpoint only.
- **i-have-adhd / no-ai-slop** (MIT) — output-style rules reimplemented natively.
